+  ✔ 18. echo: a handler that changes a key it follows fails at the first delivery, reported and thrown (1.642291ms)
+  ✔ 19. cascade guard: shared across stores (ping-pong), legitimate chains pass, coalescing keeps the largest depth (10.250166ms)
